# Copy to the clone root as .cursorignore. Keeps Cursor from indexing large files nobody edits.
# references/ holds Word, PDF and HTML originals; the ERD HTML alone is about 120,000 tokens.
references/
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
*.docx
*.pdf
*.pptx
*.xlsx
# Do not add .autopilot/ here: .cursorignore also hides files from the agent, and autopilot keeps its plans and notes there.
